{
    "background_story": "Eren was a renowned botanist who spent his life studying the unique properties of the caryocar tree. Native to the Amazon rainforest, this tree produced a rich, buttery nut that was both a delicacy and a valuable source of medicine. Eren's fascination with the caryocar began during his childhood in the rainforest, where he watched his grandmother use its nuts to heal wounds and ailments. As he grew older, Eren dedicated himself to unlocking the secrets of the caryocar, traveling the world to share his knowledge and promote sustainable harvesting practices. His groundbreaking research led to the development of new medicines and the preservation of the Amazonian ecosystem. Eren's passion for the caryocar tree earned him the nickname 'The Caryocar Guardian' among his peers.",
